  "brief_description": "The name says it all--quality ingredients yield the best margarita!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Shake together all ingredients with ice and strain into a margarita glass."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Optional: rub the cut side of a lime on the glass rim and dip it into salt; and add a lime wedge to the rim of the glass as a garnish."
    }
